  "description": "Get ready to feel the wind in your hair with the Hover-1 Instinct! The 350W brushless motor brings Instinct up to a top speed of 15 mph and gives it plenty of torque to scale inclines of up to 15 degrees. Its long-lasting battery provides up to 40 miles of range, making it a viable option for a short commute or a fun ride around town! Conveniently remove the lightweight battery to recharge the Instinct without needing to haul the entire E-Bike to an outlet. The Instinct’s hybrid frame and mag wheels add a stylish flair, so you’ll always look good riding it too. Ride safely at night or in low visibility conditions with the LED headlight. Monitor your speed, battery level, mileage, pedal assist level, ride time, and more with the LCD display. Whatever your riding needs are, the Hover-1 Instinct is a solid choice.",
